flowchart TB
    accTitle: The report of a pull request
    accDescr: A push to a pull request of a person runs the checks, which keep the coverage of the tests and the website that they built as artifacts, and the workflows of the project, which keep their parts as artifacts pr-report-name. After the checks, the PR coach reads the check runs, the title and description, the files, the coverage reports of the pull request and of main, the artifact website and the parts from the API, with the release-please files, mkdocs.yml and the parts that .github/checks.project.toml declares of main, and runs no code of the pull request. It keeps one comment: the checks that failed, the next version with the entry of the changelog, the coverage file by file, the website with the pages that change, and the parts of the workflows as code. A pull request whose checks pass gets it only when it has something of this to say.

    push(["A push to a pull request of a person"])
    checks["The checks run and keep<br>the coverage and the website as artifacts"]
    project["Workflows of the project, such as visual tests,<br>keep their parts as artifacts pr-report-name"]
    coach["The PR coach after the checks reads from the API<br>the check runs, the title and description, the files,<br>the coverage of the pull request and of main, the website<br>and the parts, and runs no code of the pull request"]
    main[(".release-please-manifest.json<br>release-please-config.json<br>mkdocs.yml, checks.project.toml of main")]
    comment["One comment on the pull request:<br>the checks that failed<br>📦 the next version and the entry of the changelog<br>the coverage, file by file<br>🌐 the website and the pages that change<br>the parts of the workflows, as code"]
    quiet["No comment while the checks pass<br>and it has nothing of this to say"]

    push --> checks --> coach --> comment
    push --> project --> coach
    main -.-> coach
    coach -. "nothing to say" .-> quiet

    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef person fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    class checks,coach,comment bot
    class push,project person
    class quiet done
